            0.482
          ],
          "content": "b. A is conditionally independent of B given D"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.492,
            0.556,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": "c. B is conditionally independent of D given A"
